DavyDuck wrote:
> What's the chance of getting an artifact wishing for it?

If the wished artifact already exists in the game then your wish will 
fail, otherwise it depends on how many artifacts exist in the game.

# artifacts:  0  1   2    3     n
p of wish:    1  1  2/3  2/4  2/n+1

Note that your quest artifact is generated the moment you enter the 
lowest level of the quest first time. Before that it does not exist in 
the game and is unwishable.

